<blockquote>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="qkv获取">qkv获取</h3>
<p>输入 token: A B C D<br>
embedding + position -&gt; layer 0 hidden states<br>
在模型一层内attention内会对hidden states做线性投影</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>Q <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> hidden <span style="color:#f92672">@</span> Wq
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>K <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> hidden <span style="color:#f92672">@</span> Wk
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>V <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> hidden <span style="color:#f92672">@</span> Wv
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>但是实际上实现一般都是fused QKV projection:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>QKV <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> hidden <span style="color:#f92672">@</span> Wqkv
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>Q, K, V <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> split(QKV)
</span></span></code></pre></div>]]></content><category scheme="https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/attention" term="attention" label="attention"/></entry></feed>